  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
    <rdfs:comment>Campaigns are instances of ThreatActors pursuing an intent, as observed through sets of Incidents and/or TTP, potentially across organizations.</rdfs:comment>
